==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|выздоро́вливать||archaic}}

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|вы́здороветь|-ивать}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|выздора́вливать}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-выздоравливать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|выздора́вливать|impf|pf=вы́здороветь}}

# {{topics|ru|Health}} {{senseid|ru|to recover}}to [[recover]], to [[convalesce]] {{gloss|in terms of one's health by overcoming illness or trauma}}
#: {{syn|ru|поправля́ться|оправля́ться|встава́ть на́ ноги|идти́ на попра́вку}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively}} to [[get rid of]] something that is unpleasant, harmful, or dangerous
# {{lb|ru|imperative}} [[get well soon]] {{gl|expressing hope that the listener will recover from illness quickly}}
# {{lb|ru|imperative|Internet slang|sarcastic|derogatory}} [[cope and seethe]]; [[stay]] [[mad]] {{gl|used to [[dismiss]] or [[mock]] someone perceived to be [[upset]] or [[frustrated]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''выздоравливай''', клоун|t='''get help''', clown}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|1a|выздора́вливать}}

====Troponyms====
* {{sense|to recover}} {{l|ru|выкара́бкиваться}}, {{l|ru|отлёживаться}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ru|выздора́вливание|g=n}}
* {{l|ru|выздоровле́ние|g=n}}
